flowchart TD
    A[Caller dials masked number from call log] --> B[Call lands at IVR]
    B --> C{Table 1 lookup}
    C -->|Miss| D[Identification chain starts]
    D --> S1{Mobile in sim inventory}
    S1 -->|YES caller is CSP user| Find[Find active tickets for this user]
    S1 -->|No| S2{Mobile in Customer API}
    S2 -->|YES caller is customer| Find
    S2 -->|No| S3{Mobile in Booking API}
    S3 -->|YES caller is customer| Find
    S3 -->|No| P4[Falls to Path 4]
    Find --> Count{Active ticket count}
    Count -->|Exactly one| Bridge[Bridge to the one counterparty]
    Count -->|Zero| Dead[Play 'no active ticket' redirect to call center or trustline · End call]
    Count -->|Two or more| P3[Falls to Path 3]
    Bridge --> Done[Call connects]

    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef warn fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    class Bridge,Done good
    class Dead bad
    class P3,P4 warn
